        "original_id": "3a97e234-bf5e-5b1d-b129-677872ffa982",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pelé, Bobby Moore, Les Strong\n- TV Series: Britain’s Best Footballer\n- Sports Event: 1965 European Cup Winners’ Cup Final\n- Organizations: West Ham United\n\nFacts:\n- Pelé cited Bobby Moore as the greatest defender he had ever played against.\n- Bobby Moore was part of the English television series Britain’s Best Footballer.\n- Britain’s Best Footballer was first broadcast on 13 January 2017.\n- Britain’s Best Footballer was presented by former West Ham United captain Alvin Martin.\n- Alvin Martin won the 1965 European Cup Winners’ Cup Final with West Ham United.\n- Les Strong missed the 1965 European Cup Winners’ Cup Final.",
