        "original_id": "7d09b29b-7631-5474-938a-6867918e1265",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Tina and Bobby\n- People: Bobby Moore, Tina Moore, Pelé, Alan Mullery, Les Strong\n- Organizations: ITV, Fulham, West Ham United, England\n- Events: 1975 FA Cup Final\n- Roles: football defenders, England captains\n\nFacts:\n- Bobby Moore is widely regarded as one of the greatest defenders of all time, and Pelé said Bobby Moore was the greatest defender he had ever played against.\n- In the 1975 FA Cup Final, Fulham included former England captains Bobby Moore and Alan Mullery in its team.\n- In the 1975 FA Cup Final, Bobby Moore made his last appearance at Wembley for Fulham.\n- Les Strong missed the 1975 FA Cup Final against West Ham United because of injury.\n- Tina and Bobby is a British television series based on the relationship between Bobby Moore and Tina Moore.\n- Tina and Bobby was first broadcast on ITV on 13 January 2017 as a three-part series.",
